From: Oliphaunt Maintainers <dev@oliphaunt.dev>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] wasix: connect epoll and socket readiness lifetimes

Bridge the virtual network readiness model into WASIX sockets, poll and epoll.
Listener/accepted descriptor reuse and close must not leave stale registrations
or discard another open-file description's readiness. Depends on descriptor,
process and virtual-io/net changes in this series; retained probes exercise
external connections and descriptor lifecycle.

Extracted without runtime hunk changes from the inherited integration bundle.
The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

